    "serverInfo": {
      "description": "Onvexia gives traders, investors and AI agents structured access to crypto research and market intelligence. Find out whether a token's hype is real or manufactured, which wallets are accumulating or dumping, which altcoins have momentum before the price moves, and whether the influencer calling it was ever right.\n\nUse Onvexia to:\n\n▪ Check if crypto hype is real or bot-driven before you buy ▪ Spot pump-and-dump and coordinated shill campaigns while they form ▪ Track whale wallets, smart money and exchange inflows/outflows across 80,000+ labelled addresses ▪ Find trending altcoins early with social volume and sentiment from X/Twitter, Reddit, Farcaster and Bluesky ▪ Rank 2,300+ coins by Galaxy Score and AltRank ▪ Check whether a crypto influencer's calls came true: every call with a receipt, hit rate at 24h, 7d and 30d vs holding BTC ▪ Run full fundamental analysis: market cap vs fully diluted valuation, tokenomics, protocol revenue, TVL, DAO treasury, exploit history, governance, unlock schedules and a graded scorecard ▪ Screen 2,300+ cryptocurrencies on social, on-chain and fundamental filters ▪ Find emerging DEX pairs and new exchange listings ▪ Query everything directly with read-only SQL\n\nThe MCP is public and read-only: connect with no install. To use the 66 tools, add a free Onvexia API key (sign up at onvexia.com; every tool is free on an account during the launch offer), or pay per call in USDC over x402 with no account at all.\n\nEvery response separates what was measured from what is not held: a null label means no label is held, never that a wallet is safe. An empty list is never evidence that nothing happened.\n\nGalaxy Score and AltRank measure attention and social-market health. They are not valuation, price targets, or investment advice.\n\nMCP endpoint: https://onvexia.com/mcp\n\nDocumentation: https://onvexia.com/openapi.json\n\nPublic index: https://github.com/faraz152/onvexia-mcp",
